[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4861.189, "timestamp": "01:21:01", "text": "我可以用任何其他格式代替 CSV 文件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4865.27, "timestamp": "01:21:05", "text": "所以，关键在于价值，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4868.497, "timestamp": "01:21:08", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "stalker mindset"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4868.95, "timestamp": "01:21:08", "text": "对吧？  CSV 格式如何才能像"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4870.175, "timestamp": "01:21:10", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ToT"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4873.43, "timestamp": "01:21:13", "text": "跟踪狂的心态一样？ 不，那是给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4875.43, "timestamp": "01:21:15", "text": "版主用的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4878.55, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "text": "这是给版主用的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4881.43, "timestamp": "01:21:21", "text": "例如，问问你自己，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4884.149, "timestamp": "01:21:24", "text": "你正在 YouTube 上进行直播。 好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4887.35, "timestamp": "01:21:27", "text": "有个怪人闯进你的直播间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4890.95, "timestamp": "01:21:30", "text": "说了些什么，而且说了一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4893.27, "timestamp": "01:21:33", "text": "不尊重人的话。 你忘记"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4897.189, "timestamp": "01:21:37", "text": "截图、采取行动，或者不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4900.39, "timestamp": "01:21:40", "text": "他的用户 ID 或频道 ID，所以"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4901.609, "timestamp": "01:21:41", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "feel spooky"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4902.39, "timestamp": "01:21:42", "text": "无法稍后封禁他。 你在玩"},